1
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:05,370
(Leonard:)Sheldon, your food's getting cold.

2
00:00:05,538 --> 00:00:10,198
(Sheldon:)I'll eat later. Right now I'm suckling at the
informative bosom of mother physics.

3
00:00:11,878 --> 00:00:14,538
(Penny:)It's hot when Sheldon talks dirty.

4
00:00:15,248 --> 00:00:19,188
So I found this website
where you send them pictures...

5
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:22,342
(Raj:)...they sculpt your head
and make an action figure out of you.

6
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:24,452
(Raj:)- How awesome is that?
- Let me see.

7
00:00:24,624 --> 00:00:27,564
(Raj:)You can pick your wardrobe,
you can choose your accessories.

8
00:00:27,727 --> 00:00:32,257
Oh, Leonard,
you can get a little asthma inhaler.

9
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:36,027
(Leonard:)Oh, this is neat.

10
00:00:36,202 --> 00:00:38,602
(Leonard:)Think about all the action figures
we've bought.

11
00:00:38,772 --> 00:00:41,432
(Leonard:)It would be kind of cool
to have one that look like us.

12
00:00:44,644 --> 00:00:48,084
(Penny:)Yeah, if that's your idea of what's cool,
you should get one.

13
00:00:48,381 --> 00:00:50,441
(Leonard:)Yeah, so I'm out.

14
00:00:52,352 --> 00:00:55,252
What do you think?
Want an action figure that looks like you?

15
00:00:55,622 --> 00:00:58,452
- Would it come with kung-fu grip?
- No.

16
00:00:58,625 --> 00:01:00,455
(Sheldon:)Don't waste my time.

17
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:04,792
(Leonard:)You get that these
are personalized action figures.

18
00:01:04,964 --> 00:01:07,094
(Penny:)Honey, if you want one, just get one.

19
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:11,030
- You're still out, right?
- Yup.

